RK3588 RKNPU MobileNet V1 Control-Chain Capture
===============================================

`regcmd-chain.bin` is a sparse, page-aligned image of the exact command
payload addresses captured from the first vendor MobileNet V1 submission on
an Orange Pi 5 Plus (RK3588) on 2026-07-12.  Gaps that were not command
payloads are zero-filled.  No PC link or register command is rewritten.

The vendor submission contains 120 logical task descriptors that reference
107 unique immutable payload addresses.  Their PC links form three roots:

* IOVA 0xffc35bc0: 50 unique payloads
* IOVA 0xffc43240: 34 unique payloads
* IOVA 0xffc4b440: 23 unique payloads

The image base is 0xffc35000 and its size is 0x1d000 bytes.  Its SHA256 is:

4136b022e5ce7831b11c8ed14725921d54bfcb7683bdeffbb0bc01fb654e5895

Concatenating the 120 captured payload files in logical task order gives:

d47b38361d1e9090a0cf2b28ff321c5b17a1eae25c4240c0f37c06583aa16193

The qtest uses this vector to verify real PC fetch/link traversal, intermediate
PPU ownership, and final DPU completion ownership.  It does not include the
vendor tensor buffers and does not prove MobileNet numerical correctness.
